sabled provider stranded, classify each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one's reroute or refusal through the existing restart and launch-guard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machinery, and execute the moves.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase agent drain command and durable operation[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the `sase agent drain` subcommand with preview, confirmation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]receipt, and JSON envelope, and register it as the `agent.drain` durable[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Automatic drain on a usage-limit disable[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]auto[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]auto: gate the feature behind a beta flag, submit a drain proc when a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]usage-limit disable wins its first-writer window, and make that drain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]own the single enriched usage-limit notification.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch Control relaunch prompt after a manual disable[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: after a manual hard disable in the Models panel, offer a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-keypress relaunch chooser and submit the drain as a durable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked proc.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end drill and reference documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]soak[dim] · [dim][/dim]after auto, ace[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]soak: prove the whole loop through the fakey provider end to end and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document draining in the LLM provider reference.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-su","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-su.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-83ed2cdba5cee3e35e6c722600ab495f","started_at":"2026-08-24T15:04:00.850533+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787588397,"sha":"f13361ca35d7d996580e1d481582ef237ab83202","subject":"feat(agent): add provider drain command"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"84c89e9039e5ac86938e304b51f3ad59ce205e03146fd4953acbfd654a308b22","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/chat.md","size_bytes":20227},"commits":{"digest":"010736320fefb1f5e48f4053cc20850023410cbc4fdc57b0af4435e02a86de8f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/commits.json","size_bytes":217},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"fd6b3a04d00717e36ddc1ea26367a80692cab635eeb26781f9679e0a3629292f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"5d2f9c2482d349b05fbf32a476d9e99c399567fa0dbdb2254a558a2c7f4ae649","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"a0db450f32918df03bb75e31d171f0f6ec8ecb948d1ebe1172aeec16463f5501","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":24503},"state":{"digest":"e617f60b9cea39abb5bf271b564240bc1afeff9bde1a5e4eca0369859d51bb7b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-08-24T16:20:47.049932+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.2","local_name":"sase-su.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-su","agent_clan_generation":"20260824110331","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-su.2","changespec_name":